      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and supportive dog trainers"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently praise Sara, Blake, and Erin for their calm guidance and clear explanations of canine behaviour. Pet parents appreciate that handlers take time to explain homework exercises and send regular video updates. While one reviewer expressed concern regarding training tools, the overwhelming majority describe a patient, welcoming team."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Noticeable progress in canine obedience"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners report significant improvements in impulse control, leash reactivity, and public composure following board-and-train courses and day school. Many clients note that formerly fearful rescue dogs gained lasting confidence in unfamiliar environments. Although one client reported heightened fear in their pet, most families observe transformative results."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for sensitive dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how comfortably anxious dogs settle into daycare routines and overnight boarding stays. Clients note that staff with veterinary technician skills accommodate senior pets and nervous rescues with thoughtful care. Except for one complaint regarding post-training anxiety, owners feel their companions are treated with genuine warmth."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
