      "q": {
        "en": "Do trainers at Connected Canine provide updates during board and train?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients frequently receive instructional videos and photos highlighting their dog's training exercises and daily progress."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are ongoing alumni classes available after completing a programme?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet owners report attending weekly group alumni sessions to reinforce obedience skills and socialisation."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Connected Canine accommodate reactive or nervous dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, trainers design tailored programmes for reactive dogs, impulse control issues, and confidence building."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
